r a reference letter\n- [ ] Send references to Kittiwake Lettings by Friday\n- [ ] Give notice on the current flat by 31 October\n- [ ] Book a van for the last weekend of November\n\n## Timeline\n- 28 Sep · Project started from a pile with three listings.\n- 2 Oct · Viewing photos of Larkspur Lane filed. · [[IMG_2290.jpg]]\n- Today · Larkspur Lane moved to \"viewing done\"; references due Friday. · [[Lease draft.pdf]]\n- 2026-10-07 · A fourth flat added; the shortlist compared by commute. · [[Flat 9, Wrenfield Road]]\n","content":{"encoding":"utf8","size":1320,"sha256":"f3d3b681fd57acb2a84df2635d0c84c1c54a65abee7a83c98724a3d38a9819d0"}}},{"operationId":"2cef40dc80f833d46e7526e2ea1d2679e57a2f4243495881c38a224c2db312fb","ordinal":20,"dependsOn":["e8dc0e6d02759df8a580d9bfb96543543d15b6077f11831a38a8b4e2ee4be3fc"],"effect":{"kind":"move","before":{"fileId":"f32","name":"Flat hunt.md","parents":["f31"],"folder":false,"modifiedTime":"2026-10-06T02:00:00.000Z"},"parent":{"fileId":"f31"},"name":"Flat hunt.md","properties":{"bowerNew":"1"}}},{"operationId":"2e7042042d6a5d963d2a1815ab8d7609962fd003fcb5be488c5d974f3367db1b","ordinal":21,"dependsOn":["0688364357612d0d7ea490c5051095e909a4328281bc60c029aa9ea4a57b2987","6db4ecbed6d8d4281eb046af4cdd44804174abd0ad869e7672f460381dd36a7e"],"effect":{"kind":"edit-text","before":{"fileId":"f24","name":"Job hunt.md","parents":["f23"],"folder":false,"modifiedTime":"2026-10-03T23:00:00.000Z"},"path":"Projects/Job hunt/Job hunt.md","beforeContent":{"encoding":"utf8","size":929,"sha256":"50555e6472f6166aef4824a9e39bef692a983facb60b0fa2b59a8b757b7858a9","provenance":"fake-stored","observedModifiedTime":"2026-10-03T23:00:00.000Z"},"changes":[{"kind":"timeline-append","recordIds":[],"entries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","text":"New offer from Ferrowick, scored 7 out of 10 against your CV.","source":"Industrial Designer, Ferrowick"},{"date":"2026-10-07","text":"A flat from the same pile went to the flat hunt.","source":"Flat 9, Wrenfield Road"}]}],"te